      "en": "in whose eyes a vile man is despised, but who honors those who fear the LORD; he who keeps an oath even when it hurts, and doesn’t change;",
      "ko": "그 눈은 망령된 자를 멸시하며 여호와를 두려워하는 자를 존대하며 그 마음에 서원한 것은 해로울찌라도 변치 아니하며",
      "source_text_hash": "ad1c4db5a91bdc21f6d06f0171c79cc10d5d44d9aee7a8425ba1f63f5fd87c45",
      "translation_text_hash": "3fa63ea0943f4abdd6ab2c5cded003f0286ab18a36df1570b8c9f5e8e2522a1e",
